      "founder_bio": "I’m building Novo Industries. We build systems that create value, making work and life better for people and businesses.\n\nOur systems power Novo Work, Novo Life and Novo Agents.\n\nBefore Novo, I co-founded Discz and Verse. Verse’s Internet Bedroom reached more than 10 million registered users within 30 days of launch, and Rolling Stone called Discz “one of the hottest music apps in the world.” Along the way, I went through YC’s W22 batch and was named to Forbes 30 Under 30.",
